g während Deiner Enttap-Phase enttappst oder nicht.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bdd60dc-da41-49dc-9471-3a3f50522aef\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Atavio de guerra de Ashnod\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f523c8-7148-4bd1-85ac-6fd000ac213d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Harnais de bataille d\'Ashnod", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf62b08-d344-4f6b-bd45-4138f4934b41\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Armatura da Battaglia di Ashnod\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'316816da-9d97-4964-b773-cf4bc74416d7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの戦具\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09df3b7-c901-4e05-b3d7-9490b15c7cef\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Ashnod\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e565ea6-c76e-4aee-b661-5d68f7586df7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Auferstehung der Toten', 'text': 'Nimm ein Wesen aus dem Friedhof und zurück auf Deine Hand.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d35d486-09a7-4409-bce3-ce94f49f4ee3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alzar a los muertos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bdf1d93-8087-453e-b68f-a80e469df253'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Exhumation', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24a48ed3-d567-461f-aeac-1d8a7654f71f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Risveglio dei Morti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92da3393-ce48-42dc-b8ce-1dfe43afe9b6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '死者再生', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0565ee5f-ca03-4f92-a1e4-f7d68f215a4f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ressuscitar Morto', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be5a772d-0060-44c7-8f01-86b05faa5bcc'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Aufgebrachter Pöbel', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWährend Deines Zuges hat der aufgebrachte Pöbel Stärke und Widerstandskraft von 2 plus der Anzahl der Sümpfe, die Deine Gegner im Spiel haben. Während den Zügen Deiner Gegner hat der Pöbel Stärke und Widerstandskraft 2/2.', 'type': 'Beschwörung des Pöbels', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65bc7792-a162-4d06-9028-ee3e48a18645'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Turba', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9662b087-4097-4383-8130-b9531b0bb892'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Foule en colère', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f49300b0-2091-4dee-be45-ceea132d4ac6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Folla Inferocita', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ae45019-debe-4ed1-9b95-b8289bc42943'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '怒れる群衆', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5db86b5-bd8d-461f-81dc-edb89fadf952'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Turba', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd177714c-7e51-46d4-938e-cd0b3cc4c43b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Aufopferung', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/-2.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42bb8e17-ba91-4951-a8d5-40147413880f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Inmolación', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb7aa82b-7fac-4890-9a88-d3d822c4d397'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Immolation', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76fd42a4-a212-4632-bf5f