et', 'text': 'Alle Mauern unter Deiner Kontrolle gewinnen Bündnisfähigkeit und erhalten +1/+0', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '347dfddd-e040-4396-bce5-2ee693d0a38f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Area fortifcada', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fed691d0-0f6a-4fd0-b565-980c6a05fb8d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aire fortifiée', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78a693e2-35b4-4644-9713-68739d465343'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Zona Fortificata', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77de921d-3deb-4638-bcab-6ad2f602d7b9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '要塞化', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0674c9b5-1300-4ec7-a9e1-1d07ba25b5fb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Área Fortificada', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f583407-c5bd-40f6-86e2-4c6a0301875b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Belebung der Toten', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68057693-dbd9-41d6-8bf5-7588472220d2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Animar a los muertos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6184b996-ca00-46ee-b770-a030eb8d38ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Animation des morts', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01032b7b-799b-4408-b15d-0fc961076c3c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Animare i Morti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7232f74-5e3e-4ae3-a3de-ee20869c10be'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '動く死体', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1a839af-b55b-4301-907b-fd41f8e21d47'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Reviver Cadáver', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69eac148-7bea-452a-838f-be7d94b0185a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Benalische Heldin', 'text': 'Bündnisfähigkeit', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Heldin', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af22bdfa-0816-491d-9ce5-0b86f2976fb0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Héroe benalita', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fa0edb5-0ecb-4355-b3bd-79c616796f7d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Héroïne bénaliane', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07e58aa1-8300-46a4-b884-856e37614e7d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Eroina di Benalia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2ca7deb-8bb7-4731-8684-c48891b05c02'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ベナリアの勇士', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '399bf56c-27c6-47aa-9b60-01a17541e347'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Heroína de Benália', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20997ae6-1b46-4a16-b24a-433e6e19a323'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Bewohner der Dunkelheit', 'text': 'Greifen die Bewohner der Dunkelheit an und werden nicht geblockt, erhalten sie +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von dunklen Wesen', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '931ed74b-3168-465a-80ff-56a4b21c13db'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Moradores de las tinieblas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cda2a59-62b6-4433-955b-70815aec91c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Habitants des ténèbres', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b19191b8-093d-45af-877e-08b5ceaff960'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Abitatori del Buio', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caa93625-4ac9-41e1-9a00-d898bdbd4664'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '闇に住まいし者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c0cc88f-9d49-404e-9edd-c1184ec81ffc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Habitantes das Trevas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd15c6ee-6630-4812-9510-1b78629a144a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Bibliothek von Leng', 'text': 'Übergehe die Abwerfphase Deines Spielzuges. Zwingt Dich irgendeine Karte oder ein Effekt, Karten abzuwerfen, kannst Du Dir aussuchen, ob Du die so abgeworfenen Karten auf den Friedhof oder oben auf Deine Bibliothek legst. Wenn Du eine zufällige Karte abwerfen mußt, schau sie Dir gut an, bevor Du Dich entscheidest, wohin Du sie abwirfst.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd130dc3e-1a61-43b3-bf1b-a95795666baf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Biblioteca de Leng', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e055725-2eb2-4b8c-a0c7-9b59bdd607d3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bibliothèque de Leng', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e6be858-9016-4945-bc89-cb8f06de78ec'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Biblioteca di Leng', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '383479aa-f507-495c-be5f-729fbde71ec3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'レンの書庫', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd7a5b06-0823-4d29-9018-fd5ed90d37f2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Grimório de Leng', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3448a3c3-5a89-490e-bfb9-557d46a7c90e'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Blaue Manabatterie', 'text': '2, {T}: Lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Manabatterie.\\n{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um {U} und entferne soviel Ladungsmarken wie Du willst. Pro Marke, die Du von der Manabatterie entfernst, erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat zusätzlich um U. Spiele diese Eigenschaft wie einen Unterbrechungszauber.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f8658b2-5b6e-45cb-92d9-49e77aad2873'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Batería de maná azul', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b7a2a12-c176-47b7-b153-625d40aa3890'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Accumulateur de mana bleu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3aa7c9dd-388c-4aa8-aafb-64ff614c4723'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Accumulatore di Mana Blu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ff2c585-4538-44a7-b560-1e0d31b15096'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '青の魔力貯蔵器', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87334e1e-e9e9-4fc4-b696-091bd12da7c2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bateria de Mana Azul', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9df1fae-8799-4f40-8bbb-1a3185422f95'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Blauer Schutz', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält Schutz vor Blau. Dieser Schutz zerstört allerdings diese Verzauberung nicht.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d39b9af-8c98-4c46-9b3e-87f6d7601aa6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guarda de azul', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e07fbc3-80e8-4c47-9ce1-655d2d1f0940'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rune de garde bleue', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fc450eb-4300-4dbe-b890-1435f8bc27a6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sigillo Blu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33352550-664e-47c3-8681-9c3df69c67c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '青の護法印', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06629af8-0349-4d6e-9c11-22cc6173750a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Defesa Azul', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '761017d9-6a57