 {'name': 'Transfert', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2cda34a-58c3-4476-9f6e-333371f6d62d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Incanalare Energia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61eb71e2-7c43-4edf-83b8-bdf20a3c801b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'チャネル', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4aeec220-cd42-4e7b-bbb3-29eb17ff6ee2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5a26938-fe85-4d98-a6f5-560d33889859'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Blütenzauberin', 'text': '0: Ziehe eine Karte, wenn Du eine Verzauberung erfolgreich gesprochen hast. Du kannst diesen Effekt allerdings pro Verzauberung nur einmal nutzen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Zauberin', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4793dfc0-3e61-43df-a48f-f94ac39cc1e3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Encantadora de las plantas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12ace6d4-be90-42b2-8e02-c8c36a7cc2f3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Enchanteresse verduralde', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '368b2679-3e63-495f-8bc7-ef8246c11633'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Incantatrice Verde dei Boschi', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '394ec273-ad23-4555-97c0-38915718f8c6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '新緑の女魔術師', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de9b2eb5-b2f4-4bac-8b5c-14fcd7d0f64b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bruxa de Verduran', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bccc62c-d010-4c7d-bf3c-4c53b88704a5'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Bogenschützen der Elfen', 'text': 'Erstschlag', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Elfen', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73909e17-233d-492d-ac23-14559924688b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Arqueros élficos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97ea329e-eef3-4a82-8549-593eeb83a466'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Archers elfes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec20bd58-1a83-4670-8ffd-0ce6ff97f7a6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Arcieri Elfici', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a78a5bb3-8d25-44b1-9ce3-c08ebf97995c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'エルフの射手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbd0801a-964d-4331-9e98-7849c11f9d42'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Arqueiros Élficos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e32f14a-de7d-4e99-83cb-fe8232a04b2c'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Bronzetafel', 'text': 'Kommt bereits getappt ins Spiel.\\n4, {T}: Nimm die Tafel und eine Karte Deines Gegners aus dem Spiel. Du wirst Eigentümer der gegnerischen Karte, Dein Gegner erhält die Tafel. Er kann diesen Tausch verhindern, indem er 10 Lebenspunkte zahlt. Tut er dies, zerstöre die Tafel. Effekte, die Schaden verhindern oder umleiten, können hier nicht angewendet werden. Spiele diese Eigenschaft wie einen Unterbrechungszauber. Nimm diese Karte vor dem Spiel aus Deinem Stapel, wenn ohne Einsatz gespielt wird.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c8ce207-8115-4874-bfdb-5b5fac422b6d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tablilla de bronce', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5adf510-19f9-4212-99cc-31ba168a5037'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tablette de bronze', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d09d204-a047-46c9-bddb-7cb45c32da59'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tavoletta di Bronzo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f35e56c-3d2f-43bf-88f5-27ec56985bce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '青銅のタブレット', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d5fdc2e-2580-472c-b899-501906ee3e2b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Bruderschaft des Feuers', 'text': '{1}{R}{R}: Die Bruderschaft des Feuers fügt einer Kreatur oder einem anderen Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu —aber auch Dir.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Bundesbrüdern', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa409300-a2eb-456c-b8f2-b30c579868dc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Hermanos del Fuego', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b8f1636-5106-4eba-acdb-93ee79669036'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Frères de feu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a09b4f69-b2fd-43d6-93e0-58df22a6389e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fratellanza del Fuoco', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f93907dd-7bef-4d79-97fe-4d096a380b3b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '火の兄弟', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d6927e2-b74e-4b37-9edd-4fe08dda8ad9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Irmãos do Fogo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92dcb1a5-f6cf-46bd-8ac1-6500b92ca2e9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Burg', 'text': 'Alle nicht getappten Kreaturen, die nicht angreifen, erhalten +0/+2.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19faa6ea-04bf-4deb-9aa6-3103878ada97'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Castillo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97b30f67-af9c-4193-a3e4-9b33a93b4a7f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Château fort', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '641df792-b4c2-42ba-9fce-20fc56cc2f70'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Castello', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'ident