: 'd207221e-65ef-48c0-9320-730588271746'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pueblo arbóreo Raiceslargas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7e22124-af8a-46e9-ae5e-0ad9477ad038'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sylvins de Ferracine', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85f493be-aa27-4c39-917b-8c0892b270ea'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Silvantropi Radice di Ferro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '157aad7a-0c06-4edc-8cd0-1fd9a14c10dc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '鉄の根の樹人族', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1f83195-1a76-4d7a-8d2e-3ed0a43aae2d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ents das Raízes de Ferro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b9e8674-b589-4824-85a2-a4ff9db71ee3'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Eigene Inkarnation', 'text': 'Der Beherrscher kann Teile oder den ganzen Schaden, der der Inkarnation zugefügt werden, auf sich selber umleiten.\\nWird die Inkarnation vernichtet, verliert ihr Beherrscher die (aufgerundete) Hälfte seiner Lebenspunkte. Effekte, die Schaden verhindern oder umleiten, können hier nicht angewendet werden, um diesen Verlust an Lebenspunkten zu verhindern.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Avatars', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e7723ca-e3f3-4ee1-842d-652f222eb5b8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Encarnación personal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a90b8a13-b9ee-41f1-bf5b-019afc617c4d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Incarnation personnelle', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb3c3896-3ae7-4744-bca1-b49fb3cb91a8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e7c8748-dd9a-4697-b10a-6ef68168b501'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '現し身', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9824e73-fc81-414c-b2a6-ca7375a952ec'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Encarnação Pessoal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b682a42-dd48-4576-b118-d559b2ddff88'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Eisenstern', 'text': '{1}: Jeder erfolgreich gesprochene rote Zauberspruch gibt Dir 1 Lebenspunkt. Du kannst diese Eigenschaft sofort oder später während des Zuges anwenden, aber nur einmal pro rotem Zauberspruch.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9db4f3ea-51bb-4368-b7cf-1d97b8963d76'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Estrella de hierro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e8a0f42-79f3-4973-a193-36f40b437d3d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Etoile de fer', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20a7d185-1dcb-4c51-b16b-258845a6438a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Stella di Ferro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '850051d0-dfed-4c74-ae11-a3b89c28b8a0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '鉄の星', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d6ece73-1d42-4c78-bc5c-8ae229e861fe'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Estrela de Ferro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9087692-a4ab-435a-afd1-1bbe84bd32b7'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Eismauer', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Mauer', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ec1de1c-df71-4398-9bb6-f80bac54376e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Muro de hielo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4de94b7b-41cd-47cc-a7a5-f38a05a61224'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mur de glace', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c934277-4d51-44f9-92f6-8172b95fc86a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Muro di Ghiaccio', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5cb4009-3139-441f-8adb-928c5d09d93c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '氷の壁', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57af3d28-5ac4-4a85-8c42-67eed0942a8a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Barreira de Gelo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '422c9718-fc48-4498-aafd-11f9292eb1dd'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'El-Hajjâj', 'text': 'Du gewinnst 1 Lebenspunkt für jeden Schadenspunkt, den El-Hajjaj beliebigen Gegnern zufügt. Du kannst allerdings nicht mehr Lebenspunkte gewinnen als die angegriffene Kreatur Widerstandskraft bzw. der Spieler Lebenspunkte besitzt.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von El — Hajjaj', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fe5d21d-a926-4012-adaa-ebfddaa9205f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'El-Hajjâj', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '410c40f9-9c29-4f09-a006-f56621799e12'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'El-hajjâj', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8365dc0-29be-4cf2-9dc0-a62ac8c03bba'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'El-Ajjaj', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa19e917-6cd6-4a3a-9223-4e3cb6dafa40'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'エル・ハジャジ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5fbaf44-3ba8-4772-a7f3-dc31bce2eb88'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'El-Hajjâj', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a6f4179-c3d0-4156-a8dc-87d62f6de613'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbeinkelch\', \'text\': \'{1}: Jeder erfolgreich gesprochene weiße Zauberspruch gibt Dir 1 Lebenspunkt. Du kannst diese Eigenschaft sofort oder später während des Zuges anwenden, aber nur einmal pro weißem Zauberspruch.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222f1645-e1b4-4c8c-a421-0c617c94036d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Copa de marfil\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb731994-aef1-471e-9bb2-8f67fb9fb07c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Coupe d\'ivoire", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30fc94b1-54e0-4ebd-a2be-27a417c3e5e6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Coppa d\'Avorio", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf5ef51-d00c-4c0d-a2cc-06df37bb2463\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'象牙の杯\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'019ac923-efcd-4d06-a951-2899c9aede14\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Cálice de Marfim\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3585002b-48e5-47ed-8d80-ed30be1656f9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbeinturm\', \'text\': \'Wenn Du während der Versorgungsphase mehr als 4 Karten auf der Hand hast, erhältst Du 1 Lebenspunkt für jede zusätzliche Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d98bdee-5c75-46ff-b5b2-6a3d6359e945\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Torre de marfil\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e95797ed-cd6f-4c93-bd6c-cd375e6956ea\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Tour d\'ivoire", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08725477-ad05-4207-a152-39bc937648df\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Torre d\'Avorio", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5ff8db-72f9-4def-9f87-6f5805d46cf1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'象牙の塔\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0e43e7-8390-4f3f-808f-9d18bf74117e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Marfim\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d34eaa7-85e6-4c92-85c9-8895b253199f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Elfenreiter', 'text': 'Elfenreiter können nur von fliegenden Kreaturen und von Mauern geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Reitern', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e53f1912-f5a0-418b-8da0-b58ca880ca2b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jinetes élficos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54d1a156-52ca-4930-9746-926238b0c08d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cavaliers elfes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdd7095c-f566-4c1a-a6e8-2f87d5389203'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cavalieri Elfici', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38240d99-c1ec-42bb-8770-0f3e9dc1fb7f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'エルフの騎手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8d4f36b-0510-44f3-a88d-cab5d2ad7249'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ginetes Élficos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90ab4a59-1168-492d-917b-b5fd108a408a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Energieanzapfung\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur, die Du kontrollierst und erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um soviel farblose Mana, wie es kostet, diese Kreatur zu beschwören.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1436e4-c930-4878-85e9-5a87017a02d9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Exatraer energia\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52774028-c19a-42dc-9ad0-bd8b2ab8dba9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Engagement énergétique\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'