e die durch Energieschub verzauberte Kreatur während Deines Zuges. Du kannst diese Eigenschaft aber nur einmal pro Zug verwenden.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d0c7472-44aa-4567-a217-74970d1b3385'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Insuflar energía', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f6e3598-4666-4114-b0e7-3fea35f9f919'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vivacité', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b0dd3db-7993-4081-ac6b-dd80befe2f2f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Infondere Energia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '631e550b-35e0-43d5-93a8-a1c974965af5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '賦活', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99748a8b-2b77-4f92-af79-3cec1db0ff05'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Instilar Energia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00d1849c-8493-4536-b769-544192121c2c'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Entzauberung', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Verzauberung oder ein Artefakt.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c44a78cb-b903-45c8-9168-31f12445c95a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Desencantar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '937c9a10-f653-427e-ad9e-3bd24b9aa3e5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Désenchantement', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2a4d3b9-e9eb-4802-83db-02a04fe19952'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Disincantare', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '781efa25-4bd0-4ff3-8ba0-810bb199ed34'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '解呪', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c015d678-19db-4cee-928e-cb4a5f5a2f5f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Desencantar', 'flavor': None