nem Spieler.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Klerikers', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '520d57b6-8df1-487f-aa60-acca3c539c36'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sanador Samita', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bf8a715-9d0f-44e0-aa9c-e242c320777c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guérisseur sanctif', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '855626fc-6356-4809-b5cb-a9e0e2d2609f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guaritore Bianco', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb2b48f9-741a-4496-a27e-a9df9fe2a8a7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'サマイトの癒し手', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2365a0b2-2958-4cf5-a49b-16552fbe98ea'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Curandeiro Samita', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e172cc08-ba32-4cc4-9891-ffd8fa5a0a5f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Fellwarstein', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um eins. Dieses Mana kann jede Farbe haben, die ein Land eines Gegners produzieren kann. Spiele diese Eigenschaft wie einen Unterbrechungszauber.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '414a1c62-0ba4-4e6e-8bc3-b8129006b257'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Piedra de Fellwar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82b87c47-b990-4428-94d0-e6d2e809b31f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pierre de Guermont', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d60182c-bd44-4ddf-b873-3d7816defd57'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pietra Fellwar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b64ebbe0-9f02-487e-ae1b-45a3e3f39a65'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '友なる石', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d8cd077-9a11-4011-a4c1-a8cd91967775'}, 'multiverseid': N