gica', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bccffa1-35ef-4671-8628-00aed4aaf698'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Korallenhelm', 'text': '{3}: Wirf eine zufällig ausgewählte Karte ab, um einer Kreatur +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges zu geben.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '660e9195-edb4-41e5-95c0-be81430f6076'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Yelmo de coral', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd11b6247-c50e-41da-a1d9-bf6cda5a3a6e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Heaume de corail', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fac364a9-4f1d-4a31-a670-948aa10c8b13'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elmo di Corallo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e38d7789-0c2d-4a37-8aa8-080834f6f843'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '珊瑚の兜', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09afc316-b22d-4ff5-ab5f-654393b6b3d3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elmo de Coral', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db4351a2-acbb-4021-844f-804e64ffa99a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Kormusglocke', 'text': 'Alle Sümpfe werden zu schwarzen 1/1 Kreaturen. Sie zählen immer noch als Länder und Du kannst sie für Mana tappen -allerdings nicht in dem Zug , indem sie ins Spiel kommen.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1a0c60c-2f24-4887-90d7-64f065647334'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Campana de Kormus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aa7259e-a346-4545-be19-60d1c232b468'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cloche de Kormus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81e8e34c-b647-42e5-aa36-2f0cd8d7126e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Campana di Kormus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a18d38af-dc56-42f2-93d4-f5e0b52c4f20'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'コーマスの鐘', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beee6bd6-bee8-4c46-aa51-da500c32ac4b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sino de Kormus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '841e97d3-0493-4abf-9e88-a56183d8ad22'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kraftleck\', \'text\': \'Während der Versorgungsphase des Beherrschers der verzauberten Verzauberung fügt das Kraftleck diesem 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Dieser Spieler kann 1 pro Schadenspunkt, den er vermeiden will, ausgeben, um sich vor dem Kraftleck zu schützen.\', \'type\': \'Verzaubere Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d34baa7f-174d-477f-b3f4-4aee7367a7ff\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pérdida de poder\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9965492-1b81-49f6-a906-5405f701b1e3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Fuite d\'énergie", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d11842-9cc4-4ea3-896e-811c9ea5491f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fuga di Energia\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'122d0203-5cd5-4024-97a3-09d9746fa79b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'魔力漏出\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bf81b6-83f7-4e3a-8395-e3081bf93cb0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Perda de Poder\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88284097-d5a5-4a81-b832-2aec8942fca1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftsog\', \'text\': \'Dein Gegner muss alles Mana aus seinen verfügbaren Ländern produzieren. Dieses Mana und alles Mana, das er in seinem Manavorrat hat, fließt nun in Deinen Manavorrat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b28c5b1-4e6f-41fc-a155-0d79da3a6c31\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Drenaje de poder\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164a0f44-e119-446a-b06a-e83aa948e95c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Drain d\'énergie", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248ead0e-afbd-4196-b2bb-f419afb2c3f1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Risucchia Mana\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8fe2a3f-f7fe-4717-913f-91a7b2fb1123\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'魔力奪取\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf41156-3f66-40e7-a230-0a02d975abbf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Drenar Poder\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7a76fa-f6f6-40bf-be62-2f1402ad3766\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraftverlust\', \'text\': \'Der Zeilspruch wird neutralisiert, wenn dessen Urheber nicht zusätzlich X ausgibt. Dieser Spieler muß alles verfügbare Mana aus seinem Manavorrat und seinen Ländern ausgeben, bis X bezahlt ist; wenn benötigt, kann er auch andere Manaquellen heranziehen.\', \'type\': \'Unterbrechungszauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03071bd4-ed59-4ed6-bbde-d5e929229642\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sumidero del poder\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d2cc56-146a-4795-b33d-388327806d63\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Siphon d\'énergie", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b89f02-5fe6-48fe-bfdf-5d3eaec74149\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Debolezza Magica\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0838e977-38e5-488d-8983-bab9446b3a14\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'魔力消沈\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ec70fe-d807-4f3f-ad91-656d9b942914\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sorvedouro de Mana\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1778431f-cdc0-4adc-8ebe-2190250ec201\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Kreaturenbindung', 'text': 'Wenn das verzauberte Wesen auf dem Friedhof landet, fügt es durch die Bindung seinem Beherrscher Schaden in Höhe seiner Widerstandskraft zu.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f650a904-cd2b-4241-a39d-5063dad7b12b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vinculo vital', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff82d34a-93b0-42e9-ad1c-405d855ae2b0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lien animal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50343182-dacc-4077-873b-28018b0de5f7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legame Empatico', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bdec423-20cc-48df-a283-9e7e8a6be1a6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '魂の鎖', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a3d4e25-d4cf-4e29-9bff-101cad2056f0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vinculo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad63e4f3-ee81-4d6e-973d-972e4feb8fe6'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Kreuzzug', 'text': 'Alle weißen Kreaturen erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00809cb0-b152-441f-a0be-1bc1048dad92'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cruzada', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d05b157-2265-4339-9155-57eb0a533ccd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Croisade', 'flavor': No