nicht zwei Inseln opferst.\\nOpfere zwei Inseln: Enttappe den Leviathan. Benutze diese Fähigkeit nur während Deiner Versorgungsphase.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Leviathan', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d5f577b-4e88-4562-9ee5-1c28580965c5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Leviatán', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '228306c3-1df9-42f1-96e8-e36f2eb178d5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Léviathan', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a34ee3b-c11a-40fc-aba5-2644a94af788'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Leviatano', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d412da9-01bb-466b-885f-8208ddfcdda0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'リバイアサン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecc63d0a-5bf5-4202-808d-be6e2800a430'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Leviatã', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56e5768a-b144-46d3-a1a8-cc40d211a6f0'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Leydruide', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e77b741d-547b-4147-b46f-b14568f20d28'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Druida de Lei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29805269-2f86-4c68-8afa-f2d7f8bf50b7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Druide des leys', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59f56230-ae2a-417e-9998-94c68fd64828'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Druido della Forza', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05ba7eaf-0dbc-4bd4-aaeb-3c330fb74657'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '草原のドルイド僧', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4135da90-b717-4ad9-a699-bd67e1b25d0f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Druida da Pradaria', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c11fac0b-0ea8-4a71-8428-fa9f4099e829'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Llanowarelfen', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um G. Spiele diese Eigenschaft wie einen Unterbrechungszauber.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Elfen', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f706a7e7-b4a2-47ad-a348-467b21e4694d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elfos de Llanowar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eae5169a-0643-4816-9f5a-d8950e56312f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elfes de Llanowar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30a14bcb-2afd-4e70-b558-bd58011118eb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elfi di Llanowar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c694c62b-26b7-488f-a646-ff59dabc18a9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ラノワールのエルフ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4929761-6382-447f-9e8c-630fbb5dbcf3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elfos de Llanowar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91932d8d-e005-46d8-a1b2-10e7d1df8365'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lockruf der Sirenen', 'text': 'Sämtliche Kreaturen des Gegners, die angreifen können, müssen angreifen. Alle Kreaturen, die es nicht tun und keine Mauern sind, werden am Ende des Spielzuges vernichtet. Dieser Spontanzauber kann nur gespielt werden, wenn der Gegner am Zug ist, und nur vor seiner Angriffsphase. Kreaturen, die während dieser Runde heraufbeschworen wurden, bleiben vom Lockruf der Sirenen verschont.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96ce76ce-66be-44c2-a7b1-66edc0d19597'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canto de sirena', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89a23ba0-4ec3-45ed-848c-a604ef450ab2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Chant des sirènes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a92c347d-d623-46f0-9728-79b4b37fc4aa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canto della Sirena', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0df8a4a-de64-4d24-a303-cd4d57c8caa0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'セイレーンの呼び声', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '260bb3b6-d234-49a9-a2fb-09f88ea8488a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canto da Sereia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45bd13be-e3d7-4691-9b3a-f115223b8a51'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lord von Atlantis\', \'text\': \'Alles Meervolk erhält +1/+1 und die Fähigkeit Inseltarnung.\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung eines Herrschers\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36c00b7-02e4-40c3-9e47-ffbf70fe0b7b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Señor de la Atlántida\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2100a12-37e6-4852-ab73-069b02b6b4d0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Seigneur de l\'Atlantide", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a064b40-f4f9-4684-89a1-937cb273ec92\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Signore di Atlantide\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4cc9460-d645-43f2-b078-4d0f50964102\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'アトランティスの王\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7930f9a-3fdc-44b1-af2a-1866064d1832\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Senhor da Atlântida\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f040f65-0eb8-4571-b06d-5e48ad32a96d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftelementar\', \'text\': \'Kann fliegen\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung eines Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af66303-dd7a-474f-8580-05dc146d79f0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental del aire\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd03c829-567b-4f2c-ad6a-2b5cfb2d4354\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Elémental d\'air", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e09c36d-9edf-448d-8b8e-960ec6024fc9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Elementale dell\'Aria", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70cde2c-62be-4457-9fb7-0b067bed9beb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'大気の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c0826d-f4f6-44b8-bacf-e10b6864e9fc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Ar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c4bd071-3c57-4036-8d18-078d98007d41\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftmauer\', \'text\': \'Fliegen\', \'type\': \'Mauer beschwören\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3d6279-8981-473d-a682-42fa28ca36f0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Muro de aire\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7380162b-ad59-4f68-bceb-e0bb38264a24\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Mur d\'air", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb55cef-b1a3-4c06-9ae7-10b15c2414ac\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Muro d\'Aria", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396eccff-f259-4b9a-b790-bbb9b9172854\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'大気の壁\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b40e23a7-6a36-424d-8b62-0669e9f311dd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Barreira de Ar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1dbc9c9-8b4c-4eeb-84c4-8e8934c3490f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lumpensammler\', \'text\': \'{B}{B}{B}, {T}: Schaue Dir die Karten, die ein Spieler Deiner Wahl auf der Hand hat, an. Dieser Spieler wirft eine zufällig bestimmte Kreaturenkarte ab. Benutze diese Fähigkeit nur während Deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung eines Lumpensammlers\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7320e343-e5c2-4cb4-a59f-9aba6f4f284e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pordiosero\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb4c4088-fdae-43be-9266-a692231b5b6b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Loqueteux\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b7437a-882e-4809-b4cb-3bb72523a8fb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "L\'Uomo di Stracci", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55e2359-5706-45af-95df-17738a03fb8d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'人さらい\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e312fe5-0101-4c6b-992f-dbf5bf5000f3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Trapeiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53522440-6991-4749-b1e3-ca4edce418ae\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Lähmung', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht während der Enttap-Phase normal enttappt werden. Der Beherrscher der Kreatur muß in der Versorgungsphase 4 bezahlen, um sie zu enttappen. Tappe die Kreatur, wenn die Lähmung auf sie gesprochen wird.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bfe516e-b818-4369-ab3b-a5bd8da434e8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Parálisis', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92823676-6615-4714-afd1-e1954b89eec1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Paralysie', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35936a3f-83b4-4c8d-ac50-c3abf2645a3f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Paralisi', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01df0404-4392-4244-af49-43bb7d52c4aa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '麻痺', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '156698f1-b0a4-4baa-8da2-a4b7ab6e74d5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Paralizar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afc181a1-39de-420b-b9ac-ce374d05eb27'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Magnetberg', 'text': 'Blaue Kreaturen können nicht normal enttappt werden. Während ihrer Versorgungsphase müssen die Spieler für jede blaue Kreatur, die sie enttappen wollen, 4 zahlen —und zwar zusätzlich zu allen anderen Aktivierungskosten, die für diese blaue Kreatur bereits verlangt werden.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ae78c5a-08df-4d5d-ba30-58ba0e279fe0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Montaña magnética', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6aef034b-758e-4a2e-a613-92268c739793'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Montagne magnétique', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd80fd616-ae18-4e78-8f83-94ba4493ee8b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Montagna Magnetica', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0819afc7-c854-4de2-9f21-55ba33d6d59a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '磁力の山', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a57fd97c-4b47-4f34-abd1-3cd6bb5ff0a4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Montanha Magnética', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7141fc04-50c9-4ca5-9a8b-e7829c171973'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Mahamoti-Dschinn', 'text': 'Kann fliegen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Dschinns', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '452cc9bc-b638-44d7-b6eb-cc6ffbcd73c3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Djinn Mahamoti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c960a7ee-4abf-4c23-b0db-52fe032527c0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Djinn mahâmot', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d7ed73f-71ff-4917-9456-72a02460ec1f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Genio Mahamoti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9feb6676-d50b-44b4-a8d1-4f0214c953ba'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'マハモティ・ジン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ecf633f-828f-47c9-aedf-68e23eabd966'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Gênio Mahamoti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c7303de-a0ba-4071-8f90-12781489ac74'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Manahaken', 'text': 'Jedesmal, wenn ein Land getappt wird, um dem Manavorrat aufzustocken, fügt Manahaken dem Beherrscher des Landes 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aefdb50-3e26-4fd4-9cb8-b58103d85d31'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Espinas de maná', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f09e27d-def0-43d2-bf06-b719ef1ffa2b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Barbelures de mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f0a4ac0-9d48-4962-9c57-0a377ff716c8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mana Spinato', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '791cf9c1-2e9c-43e9-bb29-caeb02a372f7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '魔力のとげ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11668cd5-c920-4dee-8b3d-90e63b56ad6f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Farpas de Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32dc2c0f-6784-4590-840a-6dc88c28e248'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Manakollision\', \'text\': \'Du und Dein Gegner werfen eine Münze. Wer „Zahl" wirft, verliert einen Lebenspunkt. Werft so oft, bis beide Spieler gleichzeitig „Kopf" werfen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826a61c4-cf25-48be-b456-3226427fdb28\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Choque de maná\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ba3c38-23ee-4901-9dc3-8689c1d887b3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Choc de mana\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171cf359-b1ee-4910-8309-38a7eceb1d89\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Contesa di Magia\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa46847-7c2f-4c54-be92-3972bc0a8264\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'魔力激突\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd4d4af-8a11-4233-8c69-1a0bfa24bbe0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Duelo de Mana\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16922302-b8a8-441b-86b6-b93c235cc910\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Manamangel', 'text': 'Alle Länder des Gegners werden getappt und sein Manavorrat geleert.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63a8aaba-58bd-4979-a756-c9f50c982cb3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Escasez de maná', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f86232c8-e3ae-44bf-9e81-16f461d22fa7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pénurie de mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91e8be99-72ec-40e2-9fea-145fe869c048'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Privazione del Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e62182fe-c412-44de-a30f-0045aef21956'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '枯渇', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1559dfa7-f3ec-45ca-9334-decc58b43f7a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Escoadouro de Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4328b81e-5cff-4352-adfb-2b9c17eb04e9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Manaschatz', 'text': 'Der Manaschatz enttappt nicht normal während Deiner Enttap-Phase. Wenn er während Deiner Versorgungsphase getappt bleibt, fügt er Dir einen Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{4}: Enttappe Manaschatz. Du kannst diese Eigenschaft nur während Deiner Versorgungsphase einsetzen.\\n{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um 3 farblose Mana. Spiele diese Eigenschaft wie einen Unterbrechungs-zauber.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '035c1be9-8964-4d29-a8ac-03cb9450c949'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cofre de maná', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '545f25a1-a481-46fa-a2c5-f60702ee15e5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Arche de mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5325d463-8f64-467c-9c62-815472880318'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Forziere del Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2d89e68-6bae-4cea-8f1c-73ccc94f3f8c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '魔力の櫃', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6cdf0eb-079b-46dd-9f4b-231f173b30f7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cofre de Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c7065a0-cded-4537-bdb0-a09648393e43'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Manasegen', 'text': 'Wenn immer einer der Spieler ein Lan wegen Mana tappt, erhält er 1 weiteres Mana des gleichen Typs.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20e0884e-78c3-45d3-