ge wieder oben auf die Bibliothek zurück oder zahle 4 Lebenspunkte für jede nicht zurückgelegte Karte. Effekte, die Schaden verhindern oder umleiten, können hier nicht angewendet werden, um den Verlust der Lebenspunkte zu verhindern.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '140223c0-53d9-490a-8668-8da7184c0225'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Biblioteca silvana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6234c4ee-5f9b-4f71-8b15-9d6da19ec9b4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bibliothèque sylvestre', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b13b6632-dfa9-4d27-9951-748be6fef9fc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Biblioteca Silvestre', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fea7507-9871-4b09-a90d-f71de978bb7d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '森の知恵', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2468beb-f247-4b4a-b882-beaf53829078'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Grimório Silvestre', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91e17766-cb89-4049-a1d0-e113dfc5eabb'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Waldfeen', 'text': 'Fliegend', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Feenwesen', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a8697a0-881c-4af6-98b0-01ab757785d2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Duendes voladores', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5eb331e4-ae92-48cc-8b00-a2f4b69c6d12'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Farfadets de la scrutaie', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d0dfdd0-2cdb-4b48-a490-4a238d88730b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Spiritelli di Scryb', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc98e716-4d6f-4ba2-a0ab-0399d76148ff'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'スクリブ・スプライト', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifie