original_text: ['1o\\nRoo\\nR Brothers of Fire deals 1 damage to target creature or player and 1 damage to you.', '5, oc\\nT: Put a Wasp token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 artifact creature with flying.', 'Add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'All Goblins gain mountainwalk and get +1/+1.', 'All Merfolk gain islandwalk and get +1/+1.', "All artifacts in play owned by target player are returned to that player's hand.", 'All attacking creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'All attacking creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'All black creatures get +1/+1.', 'All blocking creatures get +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'All blue creatures get +1/+1. During your upkeep, pay o\\nUo\\nU or destroy Sunken City.', 'All creatures able to block target creature must do so. Lure does not prevent a creature from blocking more than one creature if blocker has that ability. If blocker is forced to block more creatures than it is allowed to, defender chooses which of these creatures to block, but must block as many creatures as allowed.', 'All creatures get -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'All damage dealt to you so far this turn by one source is retroactively added to your life total instead of subtracted. Further damage this turn is treated normally.', 'All damage done to Uncle Istvan by creatures is reduced to 0.', 'All damage done to you so far this turn is instead retroactively applied to a target creature you control. Further damage this turn is treated normally.', 'All forests become 1/1 creatures. The forests still count as lands but cannot be tapped for mana the turn they come into play.', 'All mountains become basic plains. During your upkeep, pay o\\nWo\\nW or destroy Conversion.', "All non-creature artifacts lose all their usual abilities and become artifact creatures with toughness and power each equal to their casting costs. If Titania's Song leaves play, artifacts return to normal just before the untap phase of the next turn.", "All of target opponent's creatures that can attack must do so. At end of turn, destroy any non-wall creatures that did not attack. Play only during opponent's turn, before opponent's attack. Siren's Call does not affect creatures brought under opponent's control this turn.", "All of target player's creatures, lands, and artifacts come into play tapped.", 'All players shuffle their hands into their libraries and then draw the same number of cards they originally held.', 'All swamps become 1/1 black creatures. The swamps still count as lands but cannot be tapped for mana the turn they come into play.', 'All walls you control gain banding and get +1/+0.', 'All white creatures get +1/+1.', 'All zombies gain swampwalk and\\n"oo\\nB Regenerate."', 'Ashes to Ashes removes two target non-artifact creatures from the game and deals 5 damage to you.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, gain 1 life for each card in your hand in excess of four.', 'At the end of any turn in which Fungusaur receives damage but does not leave play, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'At the end of any turn, if there are no creatures in play, bury Pestilence.\\noo\\nB Pestilence deals 1 damage to all creatures and players.', 'At the end of combat, destroy all green and white creatures blocking or blocked by Abomination.', 'At the end of combat, destroy all non-wall creatures blocking or blocked by Basilisk.', 'At the end of combat, destroy all non-wall creatures blocking or blocked by target creature.', 'At the end of each turn, put a corpse counter on Scavenging Ghoul for each creature put into the graveyard during that turn.\\no0: Remove a corpse counter from Scavenging Ghoul to regenerate it.', "At the end of target opponent's upkeep, Black Vise deals that player 1 damage for each card in his or her hand in excess of four.", "At the end of target opponent's upkeep, The Rack deals that player 1 damage for each card in his or her hand fewer than three.", 'At the end of your upkeep, if Shadow is in your graveyard with at least three creature cards above it, you may return it to play. Shadow can attack the turn it comes into play.', 'Attacking does not cause Yotian Soldier to tap.', 'Attacking does not cause target creature to tap.', "Backfire deals 1 damage to target creature's controller for each 1 damage dealt to you by that creature.", 'Banding', 'Banding when attacking\\nAt the end of combat, destroy all walls blocking Battering Ram.', 'Banding, first strike', "Banding\\nDuring your upkeep, choose and discard one card from your hand, or Mishra's War Machine deals 3 damage to you. If Mishra's War Machine deals damage to you in this way, tap it.", "Blue creatures do not untap during their controllers' untap phase. During his or her upkeep, a player may pay an additional o4 to untap a blue creature he or she controls.", 'Brass Man does not untap during your untap phase.\\no1: Untap Brass Man. Use this ability only during your upkeep.', 'Bury all creatures.', "Bury target artifact. Artifact's controller gains life equal to the artifact's casting cost.", "Bury target artifact. Detonate deals X damage to the artifact's controller, where X is the casting cost of the artifact.", 'Bury target land or creature.', 'Bury target non-black, non-artifact creature.', 'Bury target wall.', 'Can block creatures with flying.', 'Cannot attack if defending player controls no islands. If at any time you control no islands, bury Pirate Ship.\\noc\\nT: Pirate Ship deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Cannot attack if defending player controls no islands. If at any time you control no islands, bury Sea Serpent.', 'Cannot be assigned to block any creature with power greater than 1.', 'Cannot be blocked except by walls and by creatures with flying.', 'Change the color of target spell or target permanent to black. Costs to cast, tap, maintain, or use a special ability of target remain unchanged.', 'Change the color of target spell or target permanent to blue. Costs to cast, tap, maintain, or use a special ability of ta