als 5 damage to you. Otherwise, put a Djinn token into play. Treat this token as a 5/5 artifact creature with flying.", 'o1o\\nG, oc\\nT: Target creature gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Prevent 1 damage to any creature or player.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Put one charge counter on Black Mana Battery.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool and remove as many charge counters as you wish. For each charge counter removed from Black Mana Battery, add o\\nB to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Put one charge counter on Blue Mana Battery.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool and remove as many charge counters as you wish. For each charge counter removed from Blue Mana Battery, add o\\nU to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Put one charge counter on Green Mana Battery.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool and remove as many charge counters as you wish. For each charge counter removed from Green Mana Battery, add o\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Put one charge counter on Red Mana Battery.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool and remove as many charge counters as you wish. For each charge counter removed from Red Mana Battery, add o\\nR to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Put one charge counter on White Mana Battery.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool and remove as many charge counters as you wish. For each charge counter removed from White Mana Battery, add o\\nW to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', "o2, oc\\nT: Take the top two cards from target player's library and put them into that player's graveyard.", 'o2, oc\\nT: Target creature gains flying until end of turn. If that creature is put into the graveyard before end of turn, destroy Flying Carpet.', "o2, oc\\nT: Target creature gets +1/+1 as long as Tawnos's Weaponry remains tapped.\\nYou may choose not to untap Tawnos's Weaponry during your untap phase.", "o2, oc\\nT: Target creature with power no greater than 2 becomes unblockable until end of turn. Other effects may later be used to increase the creature's power beyond 2.", "o2, oc\\nT: Target creature you control gets +2/-2 as long as Ashnod's Battle Gear remains tapped. You may choose not to untap Ashnod's Battle Gear during your untap phase.", 'o2, oc\\nT: Untap target attacking creature you control. That creature neither receives nor deals damage during combat this turn.', 'o2: +1/+0 until end of turn', 'o2: Prevent all damage against you from one artifact source. If a source deals damage to you more than once in a turn, you may pay o2 each time to prevent the damage.', 'o2: Regenerate', "o2o\\nUo\\nU, oc\\nT: Return target permanent to owner's hand. You cannot use this ability on permanents with enchantment cards played on them. If Time Elemental blocks or attacks, destroy it at end of combat. In this case, Time Elemental deals 5 damage to its controller.", 'o3, oc\\nT: Prevent up to 2 damage to you.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Rod of Ruin deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Target player chooses and discards one card from his or her hand. Use this ability only during your turn.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Untap target creature.', 'o3: Discard a card at random from your hand to give target creature +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'o3: Regenerate', 'o4, oc\\nT: Draw one card.', "o8, oc\\nT: Aladdin's Ring deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", "o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB, oc\\nT: Look at target opponent's hand. If that player has any creature cards in hand, he or she discards one of them at random. Use this ability only during your turn.", 'o\\nBoo\\nB Counter target green spell. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o\\nGo\\nG: Counter target black spell. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o\\nU, oc\\nT: Add o3 to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'o\\nUoo\\nU Tap target creature without flying.', 'o\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT: Destroy target black permanent.', 'o\\nX, oc\\nT: Instead of drawing a card from the top of your library, draw X cards but choose only one to put into your hand. Shuffle the leftover cards and put them at the bottom of your library. X cannot be 0.', "oc\\nT: Add 1 colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no1: Mishra's Factory becomes an Assembly Worker, a 2/2 artifact creature, until end of turn. Assembly Worker still counts as a land but cannot be tapped for mana the turn it comes into play.\\noc\\nT: Target Assembly Worker gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Sacrifice Strip Mine to destroy target land.', 'oc\\nT: Add one mana to your mana pool. This mana may be of any type that any land opponent controls can produce. Play this ability as an interrupt.', "oc\\nT: Choose a card at random from target opponent's hand and put it in yours. Bury Tempest Efreet in opponent's graveyard. The change in ownership is permanent. Play this ability as an interrupt. Before you choose the card to be switched, the opponent may prevent effect by paying 10 life or conceding game; if this is done, bury Tempest Efreet. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life. Remove Tempest Efreet from your deck before playing if not playing for ante.", 'oc\\nT: Destroy target tapped creature.', 'oc\\nT: Draw a card. If it is not a land, discard it.', 'oc\\nT: Grapeshot Catapult deals 1 damage to target creature with flying.', "oc\\nT: Look at target player's hand.", 'oc\\nT: Orcish Artillery deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent 1 damage to any creature or player.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent 1 damage to any creature.', 'oc\\nT: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'oc\\nT: Psionic Entity deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to itself.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature cannot regenerate this turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature loses flying until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature other than Sorceress Queen becomes 0/2 until end of turn.', "oc\\nT: Target creature with power no greater than 2 becomes unblockable until end of turn. Other effects may later be used to increase the creature's power beyond 2.", "oc\\nT: Target creature you control, which must have toughness less than Stone Giant's power, gains flying until end of turn. Destroy that creature at end of turn. Other effects may later be used to increase the creature's toughness beyond Stone Giant's power.", 'oc\\nT: Target non-creature artifact becomes an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its casting cost. Target retains all original abilities. This change lasts until your next upkeep.', 'oc\\nT: Untap target land. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oo\\nB +1/+1 until end of turn', 'oo\\nB Pay 2 life to draw a card. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life.', 'oo\\nB Regenerate', 'oo\\nG Regenerate', 'oo\\nG Regenerate target creature Regeneration enchants.', 'oo\\nR +1/+0 until end of turn', 'oo\\nR Flying until end of turn', 'oo\\nR Regenerate', 'oo\\nR Tap target wall.', 'oo\\nR Target creature Firebreathing enchants gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nU +1/+0 until end of turn', 'oo\\nW Target creature Blessing enchants gets +1/+1 until end of turn.']
